WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.900
Some places aren't visited, they're felt.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.100
Moments that stop the clock
and bring back your urge to explore.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.100
It's not about collecting stamps
in your passport,

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.600
but losing yourself to find yourself
in landscapes straight out of a movie.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.150
This is just the beginning.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.600
Behind every route there are hundreds
of stories waiting for you.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.800
The world is huge!

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.800
Start your journey with Nōmadia.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:36.600
Make the adventure yours!
